    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Explosive Breath",
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "When Mengkare uses Breath Weapon, he can expel an explosive orb of flame instead of a cone. When he does, he fires the orb at the corner of a square within 60 feet. The orb immediately detonates and deals 24d6 fire damage (DC 48 basic Reflex save save) to all creatures within a 30-foot burst. Creatures that critically fail their save catch on fire and take 4d6 persistent,fire damage."
